{"id":"d8f6f121e8472779","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-sigma-congruence.md","title":"Σ代数上的同余","display":"df-sigma-congruence — Σ代数上的同余","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-sigma-congruence","aliases":["56-df-sigma-congruence"],"display":"df-sigma-congruence — Σ代数上的同余","depends_on":["[[56-df-structure]]"],"source_section":"7.1.7","source_pages":"262","source_ocr_blocks":[283],"source_statement_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-sigma-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-sigma-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-congruence — Σ代数上的同余"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.7"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"262"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>283</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq A^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"aQb\">\\(aQb\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\\in Q\">\\((a,b)\\in Q\\)</span>；元组的长度在每个函数符号处取其元数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;Q\\subseteq A^2\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;((a,a)\\in Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(b,a)\\in Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in Q\\land(b,c)\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(a,c)\\in Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\}\\;(a_i,b_i)\\in Q)\n\\Longrightarrow(I(f)(\\vec a),I(f)(\\vec b))\\in Q\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;Q\\subseteq A^2\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;((a,a)\\in Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(b,a)\\in Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in Q\\land(b,c)\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(a,c)\\in Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\}\\;(a_i,b_i)\\in Q)\n\\Longrightarrow(I(f)(\\vec a),I(f)(\\vec b))\\in Q\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 7.1.7。一般代数同余只要求等价性与运算相容，不预设对项替换封闭；等式理论在自由项代数上还具有替换闭包，是额外结构。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.7，印刷页 262。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$，见 [[56-df-structure]]；$Q\\subseteq A^2$。$aQb$ 表示 $(a,b)\\in Q$；元组的长度在每个函数符号处取其元数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"aQb","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&Q\\subseteq A^2\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;((a,a)\\in Q)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(b,a)\\in Q)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in Q\\land(b,c)\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(a,c)\\in Q)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\}\\;(a_i,b_i)\\in Q)\n\\Longrightarrow(I(f)(\\vec a),I(f)(\\vec b))\\in Q\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1586,"backlinks":[{"id":"050e3997281664f2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$，$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$，且 $\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)$，见 [[56-df-sigma-congruence]]。$a\\in A$、$f\\in F$。方括号记下列定义的等价类，不表示任选代表元。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-sigma-congruence.md]]"},{"id":"949652e4222b24f5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$ 见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。$(T,I_T)$、$(G,I_G)$ 分别见 [[56-df-term-algebra]]、[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$。同余谓词见 [[56-df-sigma-congruence]]。"}],"outgoing":["3544e74f0e48d8ac"]}